    "title": "🛒 Santa Fe Customer Service Jobs with Multiple Openings",
    "text": "7 hours ago Santa Fe’s retail scene is busy right now, with big national chains hiring across town. If you like helping customers and want steady hours, these are worth a look.\nRetail Sales – Part Time Employer: Lowe's Companies, Inc. Location: Santa Fe, NM Type: Part-time Salary: Not listed\nThis role is all about helping shoppers find what they need for home projects. Expect lots of face-to-face customer time, learning different departments, and access to benefits like health plans, tuition help, 401(k) match, and a 10% associate discount (per the posting). Beauty and Wellness Consultant Employer: Walgreens Location: Santa Fe, NM Type: Full-time Salary: $16 – $21/hour\nIf you love skincare, makeup, and wellness, this is a customer-facing role with defined sales goals. You’ll do mini-makeovers, product demos, and in-store events while keeping the beauty area stocked, clean, and on-trend.",
